lenges&lt;/h2&gt;&#xA;&lt;ul&gt;&#xA;&lt;li&gt;Integration edge cases (timeouts, retries, duplicate callbacks)&lt;/li&gt;&#xA;&lt;li&gt;Keeping client state coherent as asynchronous events arrive&lt;/li&gt;&#xA;&lt;li&gt;Avoiding hidden coupling between payment confirmation and UI-only shortcuts&lt;/li&gt;&#xA;&lt;/ul&gt;&#xA;&lt;h2 id=&#34;technology&#34;&gt;Technology&lt;/h2&gt;&#xA;&lt;p&gt;APIs · payment integrations · event-driven systems · WebSockets · SSE · transaction processing&lt;/p&gt;&#xA;&lt;h2 id=&#34;results&#34;&gt;Results&lt;/h2&gt;&#xA;&lt;p&gt;This work reflects production-oriented backend concerns: integrations, event flow, and realtime communication — without claiming metrics that are not available to publish.&lt;/p&gt;&#xA;&lt;h2 id=&#34;links&#34;&gt;Links&lt;/h2&gt;&#xA;&lt;ul&gt;&#xA;&lt;li&gt;&lt;a href=&#34;http://localhost:1313/en/work/&#34;&gt;Work&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&#xA;&lt;li&gt;&lt;a href=&#34;http://localhost:1313/en/about/&#34;&gt;About&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&#xA;&lt;/ul&gt;&#xA;</content:encoded>
